OL,3,GNEWSAFamily named after three die in
OL,4,Asea off Shoreham
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree members of the same family who
OL,7,Fdied after getting into difficulty in
OL,8,Fthe sea off Shoreham have been named by
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FHassan El-Khawas, 55, and Zeina Alayn,
OL,12,F37, and their 14-year-old daughter Sara
OL,13,FEl-Khawas are thought to have gone into
OL,14,Fthe water near Shoreham Fort on
OL,15,FTuesday, Sussex Police said.
OL,17,FA younger girl from the same family,
OL,18,Fwho was pulled from the water with
OL,19,Fthem, remains in hospital in a critical
OL,20,Fcondition.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
