OL,3,GNEWSAFamily named after three die in
OL,4,Asea off Shoreham
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said the family had travelled
OL,7,Ffrom their London home to visit
OL,8,FShoreham and after reviewing CCTV
OL,9,Ffootage investigators say they believe
OL,10,Fthe deaths were a tragic accident with
OL,11,Fno third-party involvement.
